"the confusion at the hotel (3:46 - 4:54): an excellent sequence where the characters struggle to explain the presence of a 'grandmother' in a room, leading to classic comedic misunderstandings and frantic excuses.  2. nitin in the closet (7:22 - 8:25): the chaotic phone call where nitin tries to explain he is trapped in a closet, while his friends struggle to figure out his location, punctuated by their constant bickering.  3. the 'grandmother' reveal and the african baby (19:27 - 20:42): a high-energy sequence where the characters try to cover up their lies, resulting in a hilariously awkward dance and the desperate introduction of a 'baby' to appease the father.  4. the sleepless father-in-law (22:14 - 23:11): this scene captures the father's sleepwalking episode and the absurdity of the situation as the others try to handle him, ending with a funny 'good night' exchange.  5. morning workout chaos (24:26 - 25:11): a funny confrontation in the hotel room where the father-in-law catches the others in a bizarre situation, trying to pass off their frantic activities as an 'exercise' routine",neutral
