"i hate to be that guy, but please don't equate 30mm dakka to radar and thermal guided bullshit. missiles are vengeful bitches and you should feel bad if you use them on anything that doesn't look like it should have flares and chaff on it, be it a civilian 747 or a retired pby-5 catalina. and don't get me started on the speed that most modern jets go nowadays: 1256 km a fucking hour is way too fast for anything to be going, let alone the gs you pull every time you pull on the stick harder than a stick shift, and also don't get me started on the depictions of them. i will be using war thunder as my example. in war thunder, there's this funny mechanic called ballistics. makes bullets drop. i'd rather have the muzzle velocity of my 20mm cannons on my yak-2 be anything higher than fuck all, but it's soviet 20s, so if course they're shittier than a british fury's goddamn speed, why does that thing have a top speed of 300 km/h? i also happen to know how many missiles it takes to blow any plane going under 500 km/h. it's two aim-7 sidewinder missiles. many people chose to use an aim-120, which is a bullshit explosive for how small it is. it nukes me like i just pissed off a 15.0 br ground player with a 2000 pound bomb from a b-18 american bomber. because i bombed them, they're going to do one of two things: spawn in a tads of some fucking sort, shoot me with a missile, shoot me again, and then spawn a plane and r-73 me because i swapped to russia because i have more morale than you have patience, bitch, or, skip the tads and pull an a-10 out of their ass and not use any of their 30mm dakka. like, you're playing a dakka plane. if you're going to play a gun runner, play it like a gun runner instead of spamming missiles every ten seconds. as you can see by my extensive knowledge of higher tiers than one and two, i play custom. i will stop playing when i get my first missiles, and i will delete war thunder from my goddamn computer",negative
