"to those of you who believe he made a mistake when referring to the ""australian glock"" -  you're wrong. the ""australian glock"" came about when gunsmiths/armourers from the nsw police force, attended the glock hq for a sit-down with  the big man himself (gaston glock) and his design team. what they came up with was a pistol with the many changes needed to suit leos in nsw. (this included a slide design that allowed injured officers to lock & load with one hand) since then, the ""nsw police glock"" (aka australian glock) is being used in the police forces and correctional services of over 20 countries",negative
