ar utah ke bhejre.. hamare gher ku aake kuffar sunara tha.. tum kuffar boltech parinde aaye ghar ku hamare pari ku murda dalo bole tho tum maulaviyon raheem kuffar road pe ny ghr me bolke bhej te. kysa bole.. road pe kuffar bolo mere gher me kuffar ny bolna parinde ny aana,neutral
