"it doesn´t make sense.  some jobs are created for protecting markets.  it's to prevent self dealing or tie in agreements.  even in management type engineering you learn that you should keep group sizes small or you don't get creative results.    for example they will use ai in banking and in giant conglomerate companies to make them bigger.  but that's a communist design or communist programming.  why wouldn't it be used to break up companies, make sure they are not self dealing, make sure they have a real market?    an analogy would be in fluid mechanic.  you can select things to keep the reynolds number below 3000s, and make it laminar or you can make it turbulent.  that is designed.  you can design to add degrees of freedom to a system.  they're trying to tell you that if they have an ai robot it's ok for it to be dictator.  you have to let people design anti-ai too.  you can't ban systems that add degrees of freedom.  that's like pythagoras banning irrational numbers",negative
