"dekh bhai, tension mat le, main ekdum seedhi baat batata hoon. is video mein jo bataya gaya hai aur youtube ki jo policy hai, uske hisaab se scene kuch aisa hai: 1. kya tumhara channel khatre mein hai? nahi, filhaal channel delete ya band nahi hoga, lekin monetization (paise kamaane) mein thodi dikkat aa sakti hai agar tum sirf ai par nirbhar ho. 2. ai voice aur monetization ka chakkar: youtube ko sirf ""ai voice"" se dushmani nahi hai. problem tab hoti hai jab content ""repetitive"" ya ""low value"" lagne lage. agar tumhare video mein: script ai ki hai. voice ai ki hai. images/videos bhi ai ya stock footage hain. aur tumne apni taraf se koi mehnat (editing/commentary) nahi ki... ...toh youtube ise ""reused content"" ya ""auto-generated content"" bolkar monetization rok sakta hai. 3. long stories (30-50 mins) ke liye suggestion: tum lambi stories daalte ho, ye achhi baat hai kyunki isme watch-time milta hai. par ise safe rakhne ke liye ye karo: voiceover: agar ho sake toh apni original voice use karo, wo sabse best hai. agar ai voice hi use karni hai, toh aisi voice choose karo jo ekdum robotic na lage aur usme thoda human touch ho. editing: sirf ek image laga kar 40 minute tak ai voice mat chalao. beech-beech mein video clips, transitions, aur text ka use karo taaki youtube ko lage ki ek insaan ne ise edit kiya hai. originality: story ki script mein apne kuch personal thoughts ya unique style add karo. summary: video mein jo july 2025 wali baat kahi gayi hai, wo isliye hai taaki log ""low quality"" ai content daalna band karein. agar tumhari stories achhi hain aur tumne editing mein mehnat ki hai, toh darne ki baat nahi hai. bas koshish karo ki dhire-dhire apna thoda ""human touch"" add karo, jaise apni voice ya khud ki kari hui unique editing. confuse mat ho, kaam jaari rakho bas thoda quality aur personal touch badha do",neutral
