"i am around 60 years old and use the free versions of chatgpt, gemini, claude, and deepseek. they meet almost all my needs for research, writing papers, and writing books.  the only limitation is image and video generation. the free credits get exhausted very quickly, so i switch between these four ai tools depending on which one still has free usage available.  my suggestion is to first make full use of the free versions before thinking about a paid subscription. i have been using the free versions for the last two years and have not subscribed to any ai tool even once.  even with the free versions, my work has become almost ten times faster. if i were to subscribe to claude pro, i believe my effort would probably reduce to just 1% of what it used to be",neutral
