"cas is nothing but legalizing the operators moves which we see on normal trading days. those moves are manipulated with big price movement. cas will be just legalizing such aggressive price movement where the closing time becomes the closing price. it's a scam in making. few weeks back it was seen that around 11:30 am the spot will stop moving from few seconds to few minutes. these are gimic sebi is trying to play with less premium movements resulting in more lot buying and brokers brokerage benifit. so they won't oppose much and the so called ra, for commission on trades by clients by  opening clients demat accounts with their broker partner . it's a vecious game in play. please don't make the stock market a gamblers zone. tuhin kant pandey must gain first hand knowledge, rather reading reports from his subordinates. he will go and the system will be spoiled. what works in us not necessarily or won't work in indian context. slb (stock lending and borrowing) for few days is also in pipeline to get introduced. this can be beneficial but not cas. it is a scam in making. won't work in indian market",negative
