"this is my thesis-  no economy crashes in a day or even years. it is a systematic decline which will move the wealth away from usa to other growing economies.  the best example wouldn't be comparing it with russian/mughal empire but with uk.  a century back their markets were the strongest. when the power shifted, the market didnt crash out in a day but systematically money stared moving away and their growth stabilized.  now you can debate that this time it would be different. but even if thats the case, tech giants are global companies making money in different countries and currencies.  so just like how the richest uk companies never died, they wouldn't too and as long as they are moving as the world changes, they will still keep making money.  now that doesn't mean ai bubble may come or not. but over the centuries, this is how it will operate",neutral
