"us government's primary responsibility right now is to save the bond market by doing yield curve control. this will need money printing and the dollar index will fall.  that will cause inflation on the ground but the us fed will initially change the formula of inflation calculation to avoid raising interest rates.  the world however will move away from having a falling currency as reserves, no matter what trump does. this will again need money printing in the us to buy more of its own debt, again causing more inflation.  in the end, due to hyper inflation, rates will have to rise and all asset bubbles will burst causing global depression",negative
