"the demonstration is bogus. the coriolis effect at the equator is vertical, not horizontal. those basins are far too small to demonstrate the effect anywhere. the distance between them is too short to make any difference. the location is probably not on the actual equator. the rotations are wrong for the hemispheres.   the man can easily pour the water in off-center, causing the spin. whatever he does to stop swirling doesn't actually work.  hurricanes and other rotational storms don't happen at the equator because there is no coriolis.   the secret of the coriolis effect is a change in distance from the rotational axis of the earth. walking back and forth at the equator will not change that",negative
