"this is the beginning of saying something.  indeed, a clock up will measure more time than a clock down.  begin with that, and then what you want to say is that the clocks tell different time.  fundamentally!   not just as a comparative.  you want to prove time is a mechanical phenomenon of no relevance whatsoever, that it is a mechanical phenomena.  that's the conclusion you want to reach, that time is as mechanical as the movement of a watch.  so not only do they measure different speeds of time, but time has no relevance, it is just a function of the mechanics, which you could posit, as the movements of two watches.  taking einstein to fundamentalism, is what we want to do.  because the problem we face is a single traffic intersection, not a road system, and a single train stop, not a train system, and a single transit stop, not a transit system.  where the time we measure, for example, is irrelevant, because we are working right here.  we can obey the time as it is told on our jobsite, and disregard other measurements of time.  that is the law.  time irrelevance.  my understanding as a philosopher, is that the transit system, and train system, and traffic lights are imagined.  the reality is that you drive thru the system.  physics, is the reality.  philosophy, is the story.  the point is, einstein is not philosophy.  the story of you driving down the road, is y traffic lights are built, why transit stops are built, why train stops are built.  the onsite work is physics, the y is god's.  when we consider the universe as a physicist, we are not thinking of god.  because god is of our philosophy, which is called theology.  physicists do not consider god.  which is why their work is right.  it gives us the right jobsite.  a jobsite is not godly.  god, in this case, is the achievement of a human driving thru the system.  for we must posit the system, to see a success of their life.  the y of building, is the success of the journey.  no traffic light or train stop or transit stop achieves god.  jobsites do not achieve god.  man achieves god, thru his driver",neutral
