"i know i'm almost a year late, but there needs to be a video that tells the difference of rage baiting and general harassment to people. i've seen some shit and what some people call ""rage baiting"", when it's just general harassment. i was once in a game with a friend, (a family had been diagnosed with an illness) and then being quite sad, they weren't playing properly, somebody called them out and i said ""just let them have a pass, they're not themselves today."" and then they kept calling them out, so i said ""leave it man, they're going through something personal."" them being nosey kept asking what, not understanding what personal means, and started ""rage baiting"", and said to my friend to slit it tonight, and ""life isn't worth living if you play that bad, i'd end it all if i was you and so you should."" and then later said ""i hope you or a close family member gets cancer and passes"" my friend later left and i asked ""what's the point you fucking degen, and then they replied with""i was rage baiting"" and added on ""i hope they go cut themselves now, or i will for her""  some people don't deserve what they've been given and need to learn what's good and bad, as death threats and telling them to end it is unacceptable, and how they can just get away with that fact. there was some other stuff i didn't mention, which either i can't say on this app or don't feel like saying it although a part of it was more harassment and also got a friend to join in",negative
